<title>USA: Meridian Point Realty Trust VIII names execs.</title>
<headline>Meridian Point Realty Trust VIII names execs.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Point Realty Trust VIII Co said it has named Christopher Doherty as chairman and Robert gidel as chief executive of the firm.</p>
<p>Doherty is a partner at the Washington, D.C., law firm of Fox Bennett and Turner and has been a director of the company since 1993.</p>
<p>Gidel previously was president, chief operating officer and a director of Paragon Group Inc PAO.N, a diversified real estate investment trust, and Paragon GP Holdings.</p>
<p>Meridian Point Realty Trust VIII is an equity real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
